## Destination requirements

Each resource owns one link. Do not manage the same alert-rule and webhook pair in multiple Terraform resources or states.

The webhook must subscribe to `alerts.triggered`, must not set `project_ids`, and must be owned by the account. Configure it separately with `vercel_webhook`, then pass its ID to `webhook_id`.

The special `ar_default` alert rule ID is supported even though the default rule itself cannot be managed by `vercel_alert_rule`.

